Swing your weapon with incredible force, striking all enemies in a radius 3 semicircle, dealing [96%, 124%, 145%, 163%, 179% (TL1-5)] weapon damage to all targets.

Starting from talent level 5, all targets hit will have their armour and saves reduced by [10, 14, 16, 19, 20 (TL1-5)].

This attack can not miss.
